                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Like most people who use this platform, I own WAY too many games i've never played. to combat this, i added all my games to a wheel and gave them as long as I could. Here is my take for this game:\nIt's like portal but without the portals... In a nice way! it's a fun puzzle game you could really sink into if you like that sorta thing. Maybe one day I shall come back. Until then there shall be no regrets, no tears, no anxieties. 5/10",
